      "evidence_id": "ev-8aa8b88512b98fdb",
      "path_or_url": "docs/guide/workers.md",
      "section": "Workers > Workers > Thread workers > Posting messages",
      "snippet": "#### Posting messages\n\nMost Textual functions are not thread-safe which means you will need to use [call_from_thread][textual.app.App.call_from_thread] to run them from a thread worker.\nAn exception would be [post_message][textual.widget.Widget.post_message] which *is* thread-safe.\nIf your worker needs to make multiple updates to the UI, it is a good idea to send [custom messages](./events.md) and let the message handler update the state of the UI.\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "e17b8643350f15e8e8ebae40b98d0ea1d427e4fcbb79f1c43d92c9d1e5ab4664",
